{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "05fcd482-5ed2-4d99-a726-d45759eee0d3", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 8, "ts": "2026-08-16T13:23:21.095000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "The driver is complete and correct. Let me verify the SARADC base address used is consistent with what the TRM shows, and cross-check the §18.4.1 internal address mapping that mentioned a possible different base.\n\nThe TRM register section consistently uses \"Operational Base(0x2AE00000)\". Earlier in the TRM §18.4.1 \"Internal Address Mapping\" the table listed `0x2AE00000` too. My memorymap header does not yet have a `RK3576_SARADC_ADDR`, but I defined it in the hardware header as `0x2AE00000`, which is correct.\n\nLet me verify that the TRM address mapping block I saw (line 2508 showing \"0x2ADC0000 / SARADC\") doesn't contradict this. The `0x2ADC0000` near line 2508 was actually the UART10 address in the memory bus map. The SARADC operational base is clearly and repeatedly `0x2AE00000`. My value is correct.\n\nThe driver is complete. Let me provide a summary of what I implemented.\n\n## 完成总结\n\n我为 RK3576 编写了 **SARADC (SAR-ADC) lower-half 驱动**,遵循 NuttX ADC 上层/下层框架(`include/nuttx/analog/adc.h`),并依据 RK3576 TRM 第 18 章。\n\n### 调查结论(TRM 关键信息)\n- **IP**:8 通道单端 12-bit SAR ADC,输入 0~1.8V,最高 1MSps @ 20MHz\n- **基址**:`0x2AE00000`;**中断**:`RK3576_IRQ_SARADC` = 156(已在 `include/irq.h` 中定义)\n- **关键寄存器**:`CONV_CON`(0x0000,hiword-mask 写)、`STATUS`(0x010C,bit0=busy)、`END_INT_EN/ST`、`DATA0~7`(0x0120~0x013C,12位右对齐)\n- **单次转换序列**:设 channel_sel[3:0] + single_pd_mode(bit5) + start_adc(bit4) → 轮询 busy 位 → 读 `SARADC_DATAn`\n- **CRU 时钟/复位**(hiword-mask 写):`GATE_CON13`(bit6=pclk,bit7=clk,SET_TO_DISABLE)、`SOFTRST_CON13`(bit6=presetn,bit7=resetn)、`CLKSEL_CON58`(bit12=mux,bit11:4=div)\n\n### 创建的文件\n| 文件 | 作用 |\n|------|------|\n| `chips/rk3576/hardware/rk3576_saradc.h` | 寄存器地址/位域宏定义 |\n| `chips/rk3576/rk3576_saradc.h` | 公开 `rk3576_saradc_initialize()` 接口 |\n| `chips/rk3576/rk3576_saradc.c` | lower-half 驱动实现 |\n\n### 修改的文件\n- `chips/rk3576/Make.defs` 和 `CMakeLists.txt` — 加入 `CONFIG_RK3576_SARADC` 编译条件\n- `chips/rk3576/Kconfig` — 新增 `RK3576_SARADC` 配置项(依赖 `select ADC`)\n\n### 驱动实现要点\n- 实现 `struct adc_ops_s` 的六个回调:`ao_bind/ao_reset/ao_setup/ao_shutdown/ao_rxint/ao_ioctl`\n- `anioc_trigger`(`ANIOC_TRIGGER`) 逐通道单次转换,结果经 `cb->au_receive()` 送入上层 FIFO\n- `ANIOC_GET_NCHANNELS` 返回 8\n- `ao_reset` 直接通过 hiword-mask 方案操作 CRU 复位 + ungates 时钟(时钟不在 clk tree 中注册,故自行操作寄存器,与现有 `rk3576_i2c.c`/`rk3576_gpio.c` 风格一致)\n\n**注意**:该驱动为 on-demand 轮询模式(与参考驱动 `mcp3008.c` 同构),板级仍需负责模拟输入引脚的配置;板级初始化时调用 `rk3576_saradc_initialize()` 得到 `adc_dev_s` 后,用 `adc_register(\"/dev/adc0\", dev)` 注册即可。"}
